@startuml
title Request handling
robust "Web browser" as WB
concise "User" as WU
binary "Cache" as CA
clock "Clock" as C with period 50
WB has Idle,Waiting,Processing
@0
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
CA is low
@100
WU is Waiting
WB is Processing
WU -> WB : request
@200
CA is high
@300
WB is Waiting
@WB
400 is Idle
@WU
450 is "Reading the page"
highlight 200 to 300 #Gold : network
@enduml
